==Strategy==
Meatshields and fast attacking mid-rangers are all that's needed. Thus, this stage can easily be completed with meatshields and [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] or another alternative such as [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]] or [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Hayabusa]].

